1
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:12,500
Among a thousand journeys, two lives crossed.

2
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:28,000
For a moment, the world was only wind and sea.

3
00:00:34,500 --> 00:00:43,000
Then the night split open.

4
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:58,000
The boats descended. Their hands held fast.

5
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:07,500
He lifted her above the water.

6
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:13,500
She held on to his memory.

7
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:22,500
The sea kept the ship.

8
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:29,000
She kept his memory.
